160
00:05:52,576 --> 00:05:54,475
You will need the three words when

161
00:05:54,475 --> 00:05:56,430
that checklist asks what a grid is.

162
00:05:57,111 --> 00:05:58,798
A paper or demo account is

163
00:05:58,798 --> 00:06:00,406
a fence around practice.

164
00:06:00,926 --> 00:06:02,267
Inside the fence you can

165
00:06:02,267 --> 00:06:03,552
see fields and buttons.

166
00:06:03,924 --> 00:06:05,265
You still do not send an

167
00:06:05,265 --> 00:06:06,438
order in this course.

168
00:06:07,231 --> 00:06:08,810
If you keep one sentence,

169
00:06:08,810 --> 00:06:10,547
keep this: range, levels, and

170
00:06:10,547 --> 00:06:12,363
stop, drawn before any click.

171
00:06:12,883 --> 00:06:14,526
Bouncing inside the band is

172
00:06:14,526 --> 00:06:15,922
what a grid is built for.

173
00:06:16,403 --> 00:06:17,640
The exit from the band

174
00:06:17,640 --> 00:06:18,946
is the failure picture.

175
00:06:20,146 --> 00:06:22,305
A grid bot places waiting buys below

176
00:06:22,305 --> 00:06:24,464
the price and waiting sells above it.

177
00:06:25,664 --> 00:06:28,145
This 2023 path stayed between the

178
00:06:28,145 --> 00:06:30,804
bottom line and the top line, with six

179
00:06:30,804 --> 00:06:33,374
